# Sprint Goal 
Develop the working prototype of the Clinic appointment system and also perform usability testing to evaluate the system functionality and the overall users experience.

## Selected Tasks 
- Develop improved prototype of the system 
- Implement appointment booking functionality 
- Implement appointment cancellation and rescheduling 
- Implement clinic staff appointment managment 
- Run usability testing with users
- Collect user feedback 
- Fix any usability issues if identified 
- Document test results 

## Sprint Duration 
Week 3

## Expected outcome 
By the end of sprint 2 the team will have a functional prototype of the clinic appointment system with all the main features. The system will also be tested with users and feedback will be collected to identify any potential improvements.
